+// Pub/Sub first deliveries are often LATE. Measured on a live deployment 2026-07-27:
+// late deliveries clustered at 46-57s, and the stock 30s gate silently discarded ~21%
+// of DISTINCT events -- their first delivery was already stale, so the redelivery was
+// too, and neither a HomeKit notification nor an HKSV clip was produced. Those are real
+// events, not the duplicate redeliveries this gate exists to suppress. 120s stays clear
+// of observed latency while still stopping an hours-old backlog from firing after a
+// Pub/Sub reconnect, which is the gate's actual job.
